• V~, A~  →  AC (Alternating Current / Voltage)
• V==, A==, mV==  →  DC (Direct Current / Voltage)

INPUT TERMINALS
A (10A FUSED)  :  High current input (up to 10A)
COM            :  Common (Negative) terminal
V Ω →+ -||     :  Voltage, Resistance, Diode, Capacitance, Frequency, Continuity

